@TextRenderer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133

### List fonts
GET {{TextRenderer_HostAddress}}/fonts

### Render a PNG
POST {{TextRenderer_HostAddress}}/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello, World!",
  "font": "dejavu-serif",
  "fontSize": 48,
  "foreground": "#1A4D8F",
  "background": "#FFFFFF"
}

### Validation errors (400): unsupported character, control character, unknown property
POST {{TextRenderer_HostAddress}}/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "a\n中",
  "font": "dejavu-sans",
  "forground": "#FF0000"
}

### Health
GET {{TextRenderer_HostAddress}}/health
